!!VRy16:Sy15;                           [Save value in y16]
!!VRy11:Sy10:y2;                        [Number of possible Revives]

!!if&y12>=y3;                           [Calc correct rest life]
  !!VRy16:*-1;
  !!VRy17:Sy2;
  !!VRy17:-y16;
  !!VRy16:Sy17;
