!!SN:W^Commander_Arcanist_%X1^/?y1; !!VRy40&y1=1:S25;
!!SN:W^Commander_General_%X1^/?y1; !!VRy40&y1=1:S26;
!!SN:W^Commander_Lancer_%X1^/?y1; !!VRy40&y1=1:S27;
