      !!VRy20:Sy51*y50;                 [total HP of target]
      !!FU(Set_Com_Battle_Description):P12/y99/y15/0/0/0/y3/0/?y16; [set percentage damage based on kill count 1% for 5 kill count +5]
      !!VRy7&y52=0:Sy20*y16:100;        [calc additional damage]
