!!BA:Q?f;
!!BG:Q?y90;                             [Current attacking side]

!!BHy90&y99=37/y5=4:M0;                 [Fire]
!!BHy90&y99=38/y5=8:M0;                 [Water]
!!BHy90&y99=39/y5=2:M0;                 [Earth]
!!BHy90&y99=40/y5=1:M0;                 [Air]

