*Magic Damage based on your SP*5 is added to damage

!?MF1;

!!UN:C42149568/4/?y10;                  [Get Physical Damage type]
!!FU&y10<>4455011:E;                    [Shooting Damage]

!!BG:A?y1;                              [Aktion in y1]
