*------------------------------------------------------------------------------*
!?BG1&1000;                             [Trigger damage Spells]

!!SN:W^Flag_V896_Value^/?y1;
!!FU&y1<>1:E;
!!SN:W^Flag_V896_Value^/0;

!!BG:H?y3;                              [Determine if AI controlls Hero]
!!HEy3:O?y3;
!!OW:Iy3/?y3;
!!FU&y3=1:E;                            [Exit if AI Hero]

!!BG:S?y2;                              [y2 now contains spell number]
!!FU&y2<=9|y2>69:E;

!!BG:Q?y1;
!!BA:Hy1/?y99;                          [Get Hero Number]
!!FU&y99=-2:E;                          [Exit if no Hero]
!!HEy99&y99>=0:S14/?y81 S15/?y82 S16/?y83 S17/?y84 S18/?y85; [Checke ob der Held scholar und Magien hat]

!!HEy99:B2/?y5;                         [Get Hero Class]
!!VRy5:Sy5 %2;                          [if y5=1 it means Magic Class Hero, if y5=0 it means Might Class Hero]
!!VRy6:S0R8;                            [Random Roll: Chance for Might Heros without Scholar to level up is 33% 3/9]

!!SN:W^Master_Adventurer_Hero%Y99^/?y90;
!!SN:W^Master_Mage_Hero%Y99^/?y91;
!!VRy6&y90=1/y91=1:S1;                  [+1 Level up if Druid]
!!SN:W^Master_Warrior_Hero%Y99^/?y90;
!!SN:W^Master_Mage_Hero%Y99^/?y91;
!!VRy6&y90=1/y91=1:S1;                  [+1 Level up if Battlemage]

!!VRy85&y85=0/y5=1:S1;                  [One possible Upgrade without Scholar per Combat for Magic Class Heros]
!!FU&y85=0/y5=0/y6>=3:E;                [Exit if NO scholar and NO Magic Class Hero and Bad Luck]

!!HEy99&y99>=0:E?y70/?y71/1;            [Get Heroes level]
!!HEy99&y99>=0:A2/76/d/?y76 A2/77/d/?y77 A2/78/d/?y78 A2/139/d/?y79; [Check for Artifacts Collar,Ring,Cape,Ring of the Magi]

